# ChkTeX configuration for consistent behavior across platforms
# This file ensures local (macOS 1.7.9) and CI (Ubuntu 1.7.8) produce the same results.

# Suppress warnings that differ between chktex versions:
# 12: Interword spacing (`\ ') should perhaps be used.
# 24: Delete this space to maintain correct pagereferences.
# 44: User Regex (intersentence space) - not always present in older versions.
CmdLine { -n12 -n24 -n44 }
